  message: "Investigated 2026-06-01 for cluster context. Parent set to INV-bazij (P0 pending_validation, stable_id mass collisions). Phase 6 PR3 (ea0154e54f) closed INV-bazij structurally — 60.2% → 0.8% collision rate via name+qualified_name hash inputs at compute_stable_id and py.py::_compute_stable_id. WI-bupim addresses the residual ~0.8% (289 collisions across 95 groups) in two parts: (a) typed-tier make_typed_stable_id callers in 10 mainstream analyzers — mechanical sweep; (b) linker-emitted call_site collisions — needs design call. Sibling of WI-vodin (canonical-id format static check) under the larger INV-tazaj uniqueness META cluster. Doesn't duplicate any preexisting row — it's the residual tail of an in-flight P0."  # 7638
